# Deshab Linux desktop apps (LINUXAPP.CNF)
# Format per line: DISPLAY_NAME|linux command
# - '#' starts a comment, blank lines are ignored
# - display name <= 11 chars, command <= 63 chars, args split on spaces
# - command runs in the Linux guest via the compat layer (see dsl command)
HELLO|/bin/echo hello from deshab linux
UNAME|/bin/uname -a
LS|/bin/ls -l /
